---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About · Nicolas Robinet"
  description="Nicolas Robinet is a freelance full-stack developer, happy in a database migration or a CSS grid, and fond of the parts other people tend to dread."
>
  <section class="page" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">About me</p>
    <h2 class="page-title" id="about-title">About</h2>

    <div class="about">
      <img class="portrait" src="/assets/portrait.jpg" width="186" height="238" alt="Nicolas Robinet" decoding="async" />
      <p>I am a freelance full-stack developer, as happy in a database migration as in a CSS grid, and fond of the parts other people tend to dread. I take on client work from beginning to end, from the first empty repository to the calm of a clean production deploy.</p>
      <p>Away from client work I study cloud and DevOps with steady curiosity, Kubernetes one week, Docker the next, each layer another horizon past the last. And I am a lifelong gamer. Learning a game rhythm is the same patience that makes for good debugging.</p>
      <p>If you have something worth building, I would love to hear about it.</p>

      <div class="about__cols">
        <div class="col">
          <p class="col__label">Frontend</p>
          <p class="col__list">React &amp; Next.js<br />Astro<br />Angular<br />TypeScript</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <p class="col__label">Backend</p>
          <p class="col__list">Node<br />Java &amp; Spring<br />PHP &amp; Laravel<br />PostgreSQL &amp; Prisma<br />REST &amp; tRPC APIs</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <p class="col__label">Currently studying</p>
          <p class="col__list">AWS<br />Kubernetes<br />Docker<br />CI/CD pipelines</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
